	{/snippet}
</Exercise>

{#snippet sidebar()}

> [!Note] New words
> - **`$:`**: a reactive statement; Svelte re-runs it whenever a value it reads changes.
> - **`filter` / `sort`**: build a shorter or reordered list.
> - **`bind:value`**: tie a dropdown to a variable, both ways.
> - **keyed `{#each}`**: `(...)` gives each item an identity, so Svelte reuses its element instead of rebuilding it (and can animate the move).

